          %p
          #FixedLociWithResidualWeylGroupActionAsCoinducedAction.num_remark
            %h6 Example
            %p
              %strong (Fixed loci with residual Weyl-group action as coinduced action)
            %p
              Let
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
